# Build outputs
build/
build-*/
*.uf2
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.dis
*.map

# Vendored SDKs — not committed, fetched via the setup steps in the README
third_party/pico-sdk/
third_party/lvgl/

# TFLM and its dependencies. All vendored third party; versions are pinned
# in cmake/tflm.cmake and the setup steps are in the README.
third_party/tflite-micro/
third_party/flatbuffers/
third_party/gemmlowp/
third_party/ruy/
third_party/cmsis-nn/

# Training pipeline — downloaded audio and the API cache are far too large.
# data/species_istanbul.csv IS committed: it is small and records the
# species-selection decisions.
data/xc/
data/cache/
tools/data/
tools/downloads/
tools/runs/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.tflite
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Xeno-canto API key — must never be committed
data/.xc_key

# Data-collection run logs
data/m4_run.log
data/wav/
data/convert.log

# BirdNET segmentation stage.
# .venv-birdnet: a Python 3.11 virtualenv plus a 260 MB model checkpoint.
# birdnet_sonuc/: one CSV per recording, 7,111 files.
# segmentler.csv and birdnet_slist.txt are regenerable outputs.
.venv-birdnet/
data/birdnet_sonuc/
data/birdnet_log/
data/segmentler.csv
data/birdnet_slist.txt
data/segment_ornek/

# Training set — all regenerable output.
# egitim/: 62k windows, 739 MB (pencereler.npy)
# negatif/: ESC-50 (879 MB zip + 1,840 converted clips)
data/egitim/
data/negatif/

# Training outputs.
# tur_agi_int8.h, ikili_agi_int8.h and the .txt reports ARE committed: the
# firmware compiles the headers in, and the reports are the record.
# The .keras files are regenerated on every run and are large;
# ilerleme.html is a scratch dashboard.
models/*.keras
models/ilerleme.html
models/test_olasilik.npy
tools/egitim_pano.html

# UI preview (host) — build output and the images it renders
tools/arayuz_onizle/build/

# Field-trip raw data (see docs/M8_SAHA_PROTOKOLU.md).
# The device log/CSV and the agreement CSV ARE committed: they are the record
# of the trip. The phone recording (*.wav, above) and the BirdNET output are
# regenerable and large.
saha/*/ses/
saha/*/birdnet/

# Reference copies of other projects kept locally
rsvpnano/

# Local working files — not part of the shipped project
lastsession.md
_to_delete/
*.bundle

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
compile_commands.json
